{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't take it anymore! Become the judge, the robot, and the boxer! Punch the sh!t out of those infuriating colleagues and supervisor! PUNCH the bad! Release your anger, give them what they deserve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Gameplay:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Left Click to punch them endlessly, or Hold Right Click to charge and PUNCH! Send them to the grinder like paper into shredder! Simple as that!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step on the button at the boxing ring to randomly spawn enemies such as your boss and colleagues who acts mean and say mean things. You can punch them like sandbags as much as you want, with left click punch and right click charge attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can switch between 3 different  modes, punching, slapping and finger gun. With each mode you only need to remember simply left click for regular attack and right for charged heavy attack. You can destroy not only the enemies but also the props in the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Win the cheer of the audience and update your kill count by killing enemies! You can either punch enemies to a oil drum to kill them with an explosion or push them into a grinder to chop them into dust. Release\u00a0your\u00a0anger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975380/extras/80956fd464c2be747b8468f54d7ff0a0.poster.avif?t=1757087029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975380/extras/80956fd464c2be747b8468f54d7ff0a0.webm?t=1757087029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975380/extras/80956fd464c2be747b8468f54d7ff0a0.mp4?t=1757087029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975380/extras/fb5f95c6669e310ad3fda66dc45fb6a8.poster.avif?t=1757087029\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975380/extras/fb5f95c6669e310ad3fda66dc45fb6a8.webm?t=1757087029\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975380/extras/fb5f95c6669e310ad3fda66dc45fb6a8.mp4?t=1757087029\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975380?t=1757087029","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3975380?t=1757087029","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975380/a78567dcfdbb9c246c1b7c22f4592604f837c670/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757087029","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975380/a78567dcfdbb9c246c1b7c22f4592604f837c670/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757087029","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Story:</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can't take it anymore! Become the judge, the robot, and the boxer! Punch the sh!t out of those infuriating colleagues and supervisor! PUNCH the bad! Release your anger, give them what they deserve!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Gameplay:</u></p><p class=\"bb_p